+## 3. Symbolic characteristic and Newton data for every ray member
+
+Fix the ray parameter `t>=1` (not the local uniformizer) and put
+
+```text
+n=12t+4,  m=8t+4,  M_1=-m,  M_2=n-3=12t+1,  V_2=3,  k_jac=1.
+```
