### 5.2 The 30 unknowns

Normalize the nonzero top-line coefficient and define

```text
z=pi-gamma,
B=pi*z+b1*pi+b2,
A=pi*B+b3,
h=pi*A+b4=pi^4-gamma*pi^3+b1*pi^3+b2*pi^2+b3*pi+b4.
