+```text
+n=16, m=12, M_2=13, V_2=3, delta_2=-1, delta_1=1/4, Jacobian=X.
+```
+
+Moh starts with 244 coefficients. He chooses two coherent `pi`-roots, one in the
+major disc and one in the minor disc, and Theorem 1.2 writes
