+For `s'=2`, the ray data give
+
+```text
+delta_2^51 = -1/2,
+delta_1^51 = t/[2(3t+1)].
+```
+
+**DERIVED using the banked Phi rule.** Since `k_jac=1`, conversion to geometric
+`ord_{gamma^{-1}}` radii multiplies by `k_jac+1=2`:
