+Immediately afterward Moh notes that `f_{n-1} != 0` and
+`gcd(n,n-1)=1` give `M_i<=n-1`, then explicitly says that the values of the
+`M_i` are poorly understood. This is an upper terminal bound, not a theorem that
+identifies `M_2`.
