+delta_i^51 = 1
+ - (n-M_i) prod_{j=i+1}^s [V_j(n-M_j)-d_j]
+   / ((n-M_s-1) prod_{j=i+1}^s [V_j(n-M_{j-1})-d_j]).
+```
