+### 3.2 `V_2`, top face, and Puiseux separations
+
+**SOURCE-READ + DERIVED.** Definition 5.1/Proposition 5.3 requires for the sole
+`D_2 -> D_1` extension
+
+```text
+V_3*d_2/d_3 >= V_2 > d_2/(n-M_2),  V_3=d_3=1,
+4 >= 3 > 4/3.
+```
