+
+### 5.3 Exact Jacobian equations
+
+**PROVED-HERE.** For terms `a h^r,b h^s`, the driver uses the identity
+
+```text
+J(a h^r,b h^s)
+ = h^(r+s)J(a,b)
+ + h^(r+s-1)[s b J(a,h)+r a J(h,b)].
+```
