+
+```text
+NP(P): (0,12t+4) -- (3t+1,9t+3),
+NP(Q): (0, 8t+4) -- (2t+1,6t+3).
+```
+
+Both have ordinary edge slope `-1`. The two tangent directions are `pi=0` and
+`pi=a gamma`; their cross-disc logarithmic separation is `delta_2'=-1`. The next
